WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.702
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.836
We hope you're
doing well tonight

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.472
and now, we're going
to get to the news.

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:07.874
After it was announced
that Elon Musk

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.375
purchased Twitter this week,

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.911
Tesla stock fell by 11%.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:13.780
Well, he wouldn't be
the first person

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.316
to get distracted from his job
by Twitter.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:17.817
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.953
Republican Congressman
Madison Cawthorn

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.989
was reportedly cited yesterday
at a North Carolina airport

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.025
because he had
a 9-millimeter handgun.

00:00:26.025 --> 00:00:27.494
Just cited?!

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:28.795
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:31.064
I bring a Poland Spring bottle
through security

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.999
and, suddenly,
I'm on a no-fly list.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.434
[ Laughter ]
Madison Cawthorn brings a gun
and they're like,

00:00:35.434 --> 00:00:37.003
"You're going to to have
to put the safety on

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:38.004
'til we get in the air."

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:40.040
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.175
Dr. Anthony Fauci
has reportedly pulled out

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:44.277
of Saturday's White House
Correspondents Dinner,

00:00:44.277 --> 00:00:46.011
due to concerns
over the coronavirus.

00:00:46.011 --> 00:00:47.079
I don't blame the guy.

00:00:47.079 --> 00:00:48.348
He's 81.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:49.915
I'm not even 50, and I still

00:00:49.915 --> 00:00:51.618
only travel by Zorb.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:54.621
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.758
[ Applause ]
New York Mayor Eric Adams

00:00:58.758 --> 00:01:00.994
yesterday presented
his first city budget,

00:01:00.994 --> 00:01:04.196
of $99.7 billion,
which means we're getting

00:01:04.196 --> 00:01:06.398
[ Singsong ]
one new F Train!

00:01:06.398 --> 00:01:08.668
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.738
Brand-new. Oh, somebody already
took a dump in it.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.772
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.772 --> 00:01:16.509
President Biden announced today
that Trevor Reed,

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:21.080
a former Marine who had been
detained in Russia since 2019,

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.749
has been released,
as part of a prisoner swap

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:26.218
and it was a win-win
'cause, for some reason,

00:01:26.218 --> 00:01:27.887
they wanted Weinstein.

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:31.991
[ Laughter ]

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:34.260
[ Russian accent ]
Want you to produce
movies for us.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.928
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.928 --> 00:01:38.297
Vladimir wants to star
in his own

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:39.365
"Shakespeare in Love."

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:43.569
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.569 --> 00:01:46.605
The New York City Council
is currently considering a cut

00:01:46.605 --> 00:01:49.742
to the local hotel tax,
in order to boost tourism,

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:53.946
because only in New York can you
pay 500 bucks to stay in a room

00:01:53.946 --> 00:01:57.283
where you can flush the toilet
from the bed.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:59.385
[ Laughter ]
-Whoo!

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:01.387
-Director Justin Lin
announced yesterday

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:04.524
that he decided to leave
the movie "Fast X,"

00:02:04.524 --> 00:02:06.392
just a few days
after production started.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.861
So they're going to go
with Wes Anderson.

00:02:08.861 --> 00:02:12.565
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.433
That's right, Justin Lin
announced yesterday

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:16.702
that he decided to leave
the movie "Fast X,"

00:02:16.702 --> 00:02:18.404
reportedly due
to creative differences.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:20.239
He wanted the movie
to be creative,

00:02:20.239 --> 00:02:21.307
and no one else did.

00:02:21.307 --> 00:02:23.676
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.778
In a new interview,
actress Megan Fox said

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.713
that she and her fiancé,
Machine Gun Kelly,

00:02:27.713 --> 00:02:31.084
occasionally drink a few drops
of each other's blood,

00:02:31.084 --> 00:02:32.952
for "ritual purposes only."

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:34.553
You know what?

00:02:34.553 --> 00:02:37.890
These guys are a perfect couple,
because I look at them

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:40.592
and I cannot guess
whose idea that was.

00:02:40.592 --> 00:02:42.295
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:45.063
You know how, sometimes you'll
see a couple jogging in the park

00:02:45.063 --> 00:02:47.866
and you'll say, "Oh,
she dragged his ass out there,"

00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:50.302
or, "This was clearly his idea.

00:02:50.302 --> 00:02:51.737
She's jogging in jeans."

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:53.606
[ Laughter ]
Not here.

00:02:53.606 --> 00:02:56.242
Either one of these two
could've paused "Dateline"

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.244
and turned to the other one
and said,

00:02:58.244 --> 00:02:59.912
"We should drink
each other's blood."

00:02:59.912 --> 00:03:01.280
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.650
Perfect match.

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:04.883
I have no notes.

00:03:04.883 --> 00:03:06.686
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:09.288
And, finally,
singer Harry Styles will be

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:12.658
on the June cover of the
magazine Better Homes &amp; Gardens.

00:03:12.658 --> 00:03:14.393
And this is cool --
Martha Stewart

00:03:14.393 --> 00:03:15.695
is on Tiger Beat.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:18.665
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.504 --> 00:03:27.640
And that was a monologue.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.409
Tiger Beat.
[ Cheering and applause ]

